WEBVTT

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.940
This room is yours.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:14.100
These coins are the 
memories of the Selectors?

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.410
You are the new law.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:22.000
Show us your battle.

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:53.880
Your battle.

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:55.470
Your battle.

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:58.230
Begin. Quickly.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:00.720
There will be no more battles.

00:02:01.250 --> 00:02:05.060
I'll release all the memories 
and return them to their owners.

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:09.020
I've come here to end the Selector battles.

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.740
End the battles?

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:16.480
This is a place of beginnings.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:19.540
An ending cannot be allowed.

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:22.380
We won't let it end.

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:23.410
We won't allow it.

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:43.800
<i>My heart is being taken over by darkness...</i>

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:48.630
Battle...

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:54.540
Everyone...  should just disappear...

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:00.200
Kiyoi!

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:12.080
You want a battle, don't you?

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:19.130
Then I'll defeat you and create a new law!

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:26.810
Open!

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:54.210
Grow.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.550
Attack.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:11.660
Defend.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:15.650
Attack.

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.080
Attack.

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.530
Attack.

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:23.200
Attack.

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:30.450
This isn't a WIXOSS battle!

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:33.500
This is my battle.

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:43.950
Piruluk!

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:45.130
Leave it to me!

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:52.140
Burning!

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:55.670
I'll take the clones.

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:56.810
Yuzuki!

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:59.360
Escape!

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:03.780
Concentrate!

00:05:10.020 --> 00:05:11.860
Yuki, where are you?

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:13.750
Right here, Tama.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:18.020
Yuki! Just hang in there. I'll save you.

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:21.840
Tama, think back. Remember 
the last time you came here.

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:27.700
The truth is, we aren't prisoners at all.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.740
What we need in order to escape is...

00:05:37.260 --> 00:05:38.700
...to choose!

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:50.740
I got out!

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.840
I felt it inside the door.

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:56.600
The last heart that Mayu left behind...

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:57.460
Mayu?

00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:00.710
This isn't the real door.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:03.920
An LRIG becomes the key and opens the door.

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.460
No, that's not right.

00:06:06.460 --> 00:06:09.840
That just opens a series of endlessly 
opening doors with no exit.

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:13.150
Where is the real door?

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:14.250
Nowhere.

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:15.750
Not right now.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.640
This is the room of white windows.

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:27.190
All that's here is the 
scenery beyond the window

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.340
that you can't reach.

00:06:36.400 --> 00:06:40.340
Mayu was all alone here...

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:55.180
Why?

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:58.230
Why would you end it?

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.940
What waits for you when it's over?

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:05.790
Everyone gets their memories back and 
returns to their old lives. That's all.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.170
Why do you seek memories?

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:10.800
Memories make people suffer.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.150
You're no different.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:14.450
That's because of who I am.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:18.890
Painful memories, stressful memories,
filthy memories...

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.910
I'm made up of all of them.

00:07:21.660 --> 00:07:23.760
I'm going to take back myself.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:26.800
That is my choice!

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:35.390
Suzu...

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:38.430
Chi-chan, I'm sorry.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:42.060
I broke our promise.

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:47.610
I entrusted your memories, 
and everyone else's, to Kiyoi-chan.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:52.240
Because I believed that she 
would be able to get them back.

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:54.980
I want to be with you, Chi-chan.

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:58.700
I want to be the closest person to you 
when your memories come back.

00:07:59.560 --> 00:08:03.500
No matter what happens, I want to 
accept them, together with you.

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:09.260
Yeah... Thanks.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:12.720
So, while we're waiting for 
your memories to come back,

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.410
I thought we could eat some cookies.

00:08:15.410 --> 00:08:17.200
I'm pretty confident about these!

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.650
They're good.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:31.670
<i>Kiyoi-chan...</i>

00:08:33.560 --> 00:08:34.740
Attack.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:47.880
The battles will continue... forever.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.500
I'll end them here!

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:01.340
I won't...

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:04.430
let the battles end!

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.550
Everyone!

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:14.490
Out of the way, wimps!

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:25.250
This power is great...

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.960
Sure, I can go crazier! <i>Much</i> crazier!

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:32.420
Kiyoi-chan, where are you?

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:33.970
Play with me!

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:36.100
Forever and ever!

00:09:35.210 --> 00:09:36.100
Tentacle!

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:36.770
What?

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:39.600
We won't let you go.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:41.600
You're fighting <i>us</i>.

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.620
Um...

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:45.700
What do we do?

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.500
Stop freaking out!

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:51.400
Blind.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.700
Burning!

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:06.290
If you would destroy the law,

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:08.500
you must bend it to your will by force.

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:11.070
You can't destroy it.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:15.340
I will release everything.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.300
For my friends...

00:10:18.060 --> 00:10:19.730
And for you!

00:10:24.630 --> 00:10:26.560
Release everything...

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:31.210
Brother... will come back?

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:34.710
Then Sumida-san will also...

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:38.820
Change of plans...

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:41.150
We're changing our target!

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:42.280
O-Okay!

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:50.390
I betrayed ya!

00:10:50.390 --> 00:10:51.960
I-I'm sorry!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.500
Riru, are you okay?

00:10:56.500 --> 00:10:57.170
Yeah.

00:10:57.480 --> 00:10:59.550
Come get me!

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:06.260
Look at how desperate she is...

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:10.920
Humans are such strange creatures.

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:14.320
It hurts, run-run!

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.310
Thank you-run!

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:19.740
You're welcome.

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:21.940
Fractal Cage!

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:34.580
You can't do it.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:45.220
It hasn't changed since the last time I came.

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:50.120
Confirmation. This is the room 
of the beginning, correct?

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:51.590
I think so.

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:55.720
This is where the Selector 
battles were born, I think.

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:59.480
Yuki said the real door was in here.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:00.710
Inexplicable.

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:04.640
The only door I see is the one 
that connects to the hallway.

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:07.540
The room of the beginning...

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.660
The real door...

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:13.000
Do you remember, Tama?

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:16.630
The last message Mayu gave 
us before she disappeared.

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.090
Yeah.

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:23.090
When she left us,

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:26.670
this room was supposed to disappear,

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:28.640
and so were we.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:36.530
Take flight, to the real sky...

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:47.160
But Mayu made a choice—for us, and for 
black and white, to remain in this world.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:47.660
Yeah...

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:52.540
But at the same time, that meant the 
room of white windows remained, too.

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:56.200
Just as we exist,

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:58.600
this room will continue to exist, as well.

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:02.840
As a receptacle of human sorrow, 
hatred, and despair.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.150
No...

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:06.280
Because we're here?

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:08.100
No, that's not it.

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:13.640
We're not Shiro and Kuro anymore.

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:17.920
Mayu and Ruu gave us 
new names and new lives.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:21.910
We have the power to choose.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:23.200
Yeah.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:26.670
Don't be a keyhole. Be a key.

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:28.160
A key!

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:31.690
Ruu will find the door, I know it.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.960
Mayu was always alone.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.880
The outside world...

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:40.420
Longing, hatred...

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:43.390
All kinds of emotions filled her heart,

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:44.620
overflowed,

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:47.090
and were painted over...

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:07.640
Someone who could handle all of Mayu's 
mixed-up, colorless feelings

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:09.470
that she couldn't tell anyone about...

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:12.570
Imaginary friends.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.370
Acceptance.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:16.960
This looks exactly like 
the room of white windows.

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:20.920
There's no door.

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:23.540
Mayu didn't understand...

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:25.690
If she had painted a door,

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:28.380
she and everyone else 
could've gone outside to play.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:36.180
A door!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:38.080
Ruu!

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:39.440
Go, Tama.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:40.480
Yeah!

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:47.740
Happening!

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:03.420
Try to endure it all you want, but it's no use.

00:15:03.970 --> 00:15:06.000
You cannot be the law.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:09.010
Then why did you choose me?

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:13.760
You told me to find you.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:18.860
Hatred, sorrow, the desire to destroy...

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:21.190
Is that all you are?

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.150
It's not!

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:26.560
You, all of you,

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:29.760
seek out and enjoy the battles...

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.110
But deep in your hearts, you seek salvation.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.320
Salvation...

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:36.330
I want to end this.

00:15:36.820 --> 00:15:38.450
I want to escape this darkness.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:42.240
Wishes, dreams, memories...

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:45.950
No matter how many precious things 
you steal, you'll never be fulfilled.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:50.670
With each battle, the laws are warped, 
and you even lose the freedom to choose.

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:53.910
Nobody wants this.

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:59.180
A small light remaining within darkness 
that threatens to swallow you up...

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:01.850
You do know what I'm 
talking about, don't you?

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:09.340
I...

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:13.530
Grow.

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:27.730
Peeping Analyze.

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:40.140
That is your choice...

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:53.450
They're turning into coins...

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:03.290
Kiyoi!

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:05.040
Piruluk.

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:07.060
It's finally time.

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:07.980
Yes.

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:10.190
We'll bring an end to all of this.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:23.400
Catharthis.

00:17:49.510 --> 00:17:51.670
The memories are returning.

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:55.920
All the feelings everyone had...

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:03.850
Yes!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:06.270
I'll be heading back before you guys!

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:08.090
Looks like it's over.

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:09.850
Yeah. Finally.

00:18:10.900 --> 00:18:13.820
Kiyoi-chan, let's play some more!

00:18:16.140 --> 00:18:19.490
We're going to disappear, aren't we?

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:22.990
We were born from Suzu 
and Chinatsu's memories.

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:25.420
We're just going to return to them.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.140
Will Chi-chan be okay?

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.990
I wanted to see her again.

00:18:29.990 --> 00:18:31.370
Yeah.

00:18:31.370 --> 00:18:33.700
But I'm sure it'll be fine,

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.340
knowing the two of them.

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:37.160
Bye-bye, Shou-chan.

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:39.680
Hanna-sama, farewell.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.680
I'm so happy for you, brother!

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:47.480
Complete defeat, huh?

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:54.150
I got you back one!

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:56.770
You battle junkie...

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:01.030
I guess this is goodbye, Kiyoi.

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:02.410
I don't know about that.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:06.220
I can't prove it, but maybe...

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.710
So I won't say goodbye.

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:11.470
I see. Then neither will I.

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:13.690
Thanks, Kiyoi.

00:19:13.690 --> 00:19:15.460
This was fun!

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:41.820
Sakaguchi...

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:06.140
Chi-chan?

00:20:06.480 --> 00:20:10.130
M-My memories...

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:13.890
Chi-chan!

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:15.950
It's okay... It's okay!

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:18.640
I'm right here. And I always will be.

00:20:18.640 --> 00:20:22.340
Suzu... Suzu...

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:26.680
Let's talk a whole bunch.

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:28.760
About elementary school,

00:20:28.760 --> 00:20:30.860
about our favorite foods,

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:32.170
about WIXOSS...

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:33.260
I...

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.660
You can take your time.

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:36.330
Slowly...

00:20:38.450 --> 00:20:40.450
We'll overcome it together.

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:43.660
Hey!

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:44.220
Ruu!

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:45.000
Hitoe!

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:46.210
Hanna-san!

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:46.820
Tama! Yuzuki!

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.000
Welcome back!

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:03.120
<i>The Selector battles are over.</i>

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.660
I'm back!

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:18.580
<i>Not all of the pain is gone.</i>

00:21:19.890 --> 00:21:22.610
<i>Not everything is back to the way it was.</i>

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:29.980
<i>But still...</i>

00:21:46.760 --> 00:21:48.030
Morikawa.

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:53.790
I'm so glad...

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:58.150
Yeah. I'm okay.

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:08.630
<b>6 Months Later</b>

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:18.480
<i>Memories...</i>

00:22:18.960 --> 00:22:21.440
<i>They're uncertain and nebulous things.</i>

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.650
<i>You just give them color in your own mind,</i>

00:22:24.400 --> 00:22:28.740
<i>selecting the ones you choose 
to be "happy" or "sad."</i>

00:22:30.440 --> 00:22:34.220
<i>Memories change color every day in my mind.</i>

00:22:36.450 --> 00:22:37.350
<i>Still...</i>

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:41.980
<i>No matter how sad those memories are...</i>

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:45.420
<i>I don't want to be rid of them.</i>

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:49.720
<i>Because they're a part of me.</i>

00:23:01.270 --> 00:23:03.480
<b>Want to do a WIXOSS tournament?</b>

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:04.190
<b>Sure!</b>

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:04.900
<b>I'm in.</b>

00:23:03.770 --> 00:23:05.730
<b>Sounds fun.</b>

00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:06.400
<b>I'll play!</b>

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:06.900
<b>I won't lose!</b>

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:09.610
<b>I'll play!</b>

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:09.610
<b>I won't lose!</b>

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:09.320
<i>Because I don't want to let all my choices,</i>

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:09.610
<b>When?</b>

00:23:09.320 --> 00:23:10.910
<i>all my encounters,</i>

00:23:11.670 --> 00:23:13.320
<i>be a lie.</i>

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:18.010
<i>And because I want to make the 
choices I'll make in the future</i>

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:22.060
<i>with my head held high.</i>

00:23:30.500 --> 00:23:31.770
Open!

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:36.930
Light
